{"id":"vod_sn_39001","vodId":"39001","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"小森同学拒绝不了！","name_cn":"小森同学拒绝不了！","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/17e01cac0dcd61d47c05288ff5d7bdbd.jpg"},"summary":"小森朱梨（内田彩 配音）是一个身高足足有一米八的健壮女孩，参加了校田径部的她是队内的种子选手，深得同伴和教练的信赖。虽然小森外表看上去不好接近，但实际上个性却非常善良，对于他人的请求，小森无论如何都无法拒绝，虽然这样的特质给她惹出了不少的麻烦，却也令她在不知不觉之中掌握了很多他人鲜少能够掌握的特殊技能。　　一头金发看上去好像一个不良少女个性却意外的单纯的西鸟惠（小泽亚李 配音）、小森的青梅竹马，沉默寡言深藏不露的根岸真子（长绳麻理亚 配音）、同班同学大谷九郎（竹下礼奈 配音），每天和好朋友们在一起，快乐的日常就此拉开序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:06:28","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fqesKAbTZS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BAk275PLht1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eNUqZSS5mY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/533xFeZ4ah1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/34wZQWWiQA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/chNsvnhZQa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aQydjBWjvx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gmhhiWgQf71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cTFz2MQnqM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FL0HbgKwYn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mVPuSSDcYW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/triSWnrtzy1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:51.661Z"}